{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">謝賢（四哥）近日離世，享年89歲。其子謝霆鋒早前專程由內地趕回香港，陪伴父親走完人生最後一程，並低調處理身後事。經歷喪父之痛的謝霆鋒秉持「The show must go on」的專業精神，於昨日（25日）如期在青島舉行演唱會。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Screenshot_20260726_100331_01.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026XcumfqVqHO1785033775.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Screenshot_20260726_100331_01.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">​</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Screenshot_20260726_100423_01.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026owusnra8W31785033774.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Screenshot_20260726_100423_01.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">據網民在社交平台分享的現場片段顯示，謝霆鋒當晚全身穿著黑色服飾登場。在演唱經典歌曲《謝謝你的愛1999》時，他情感投入，唱至第一句歌詞「說再見別說永遠，再見不會是永遠」時歌聲帶有哽咽且眼泛淚光。隨後獻唱《遊樂場》期間，他更一度摘下墨鏡擦拭眼淚，完成演出。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Screenshot_20260726_100354_01.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026P1gCtCLJBr1785034156.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Screenshot_20260726_100354_01.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">​青島當地在演唱會開騷前數小時曾下大雨，直至正式開演前停雨。謝霆鋒在台上表示：「我們也非常幸運，現在是沒有下雨了，因為我們都是帶著很大的正能量，所以謝謝你。」說畢他抬頭望向夜空揮手致意。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Screenshot_20260726_100447_01.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026objO1i209K1785033774.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Screenshot_20260726_100447_01.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">​</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Screenshot_20260726_100522_01.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026eGZ21uuwta1785033773.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Screenshot_20260726_100522_01.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Screenshot_20260726_100536_01.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026n0bil8QAXp1785033773.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Screenshot_20260726_100536_01.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今日（26日）凌晨，謝霆鋒於社交平台 Instagram 上載演唱會精華片段，並配上其個人作品《青空》。影片結尾顯示他在舞台上向全場觀眾90度深深鞠躬，並附上父親生前常說的語句「The show must go on」，展現其敬業態度。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-26T03:18:28.233085+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":459,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}